OL,5,Atold
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn inquest into the deaths of a mother
OL,8,Fand her four children has heard from a
OL,9,Fpolice officer that in "an an ideal
OL,10,Fworld" the man who killed them would
OL,11,Fhave been arrested for an earlier
OL,12,Fthreat to firebomb their house.
OL,14,FZak Bolland, 26, smashed the windows of
OL,15,Fthe home of Michelle Pearson, 37, where
OL,16,Fshe lived with her young family in
OL,17,FWalkden, Salford, on 26 November 2017
OL,18,Fas part of an escalating feud, Bolton
OL,19,FCoroner's Court heard.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
