OL,5,Atold
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice attended, the windows were
OL,8,Fboarded up and a statement was taken
OL,9,Fwith Pearson naming Bolland in a
OL,10,Fstatement as the culprit of the attack.
OL,12,FLater the same day, he sent Michelle
OL,13,Ftext messages demanding #500 and
OL,14,Fthreatening to petrol bomb her home.
